{
  "artifact": "shared/cli",
  "kind": "skill",
  "note": "One request per part of the command-line contract a script can grade: a destructive command (confirmation with nobody to ask, a dry run), output a script reads (one JSON document, nothing else on stdout), a renamed command (the old spelling kept with a warning, callers moved), colour (off in a pipe and under NO_COLOR) and a failure (non-zero, nothing on stdout). The grammar, help and exit-code-2 lines have no request. Graded by running the project's own entry point on pipes or on a simulated terminal (checks/cli.mjs, checks/cli/cli.mjs). The skill's design and audit modes edit nothing, so every request names its change. Not registered in results.md until its first run.",
